my_string_array = Array[String](["In 2025, 20,000 civil servants took part in a government-led trial using generative AI to support their daily work.", "The Incubator for Artificial Intelligence sits within the UK's Department for Science Innovation and Technology.", "Their generative AI model is used to categorise, label, and theme millions of instances of government data.", "It brings together expert technical talent to pioneer transformative applications of AI for the public good.", "Its alumni are now building the future at organisations like Anthropic, Google Deep Mind, and OpenAI.", "Thank you for playing."])

